It is five o'clock.
I step out of the office.
It suddenly becomes very dark outside.
I look at the sky.
There are big black clouds in the sky.
It was very sunny in the morning.
But now there is no sunlight at all.
Likewise, it is not hot at all now.
A strong wind blows in the campus.
This wind is very cool.
My hair flies in the wind.
I remember the morning forecast.
Yes, it will definitely rain today.
A heavy rain will fall soon.
Oh no, I do not have an umbrella with me.
I need to go home quickly.
